config ZMK_INPUT_PROCESSOR_VOLUME
    bool "Volume Input Processor"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_ZMK_INPUT_PROCESSOR_VOLUME_ENABLED
    help
      Enables the volume input processor which converts continuous REL
      axis motion (e.g. from a trackball) into C_VOL_UP / C_VOL_DN
      key presses using a signed accumulator with configurable threshold.
